  "source": "VoiceCommand-WebServer/assets/ToolsPrompt.txt (44 tools incl. DefaultResponse, Alpha..Zulu). LOCKED final set, part 5a: written from the tool contract only; eval_cases.json and heldout_cases.json..heldout4_cases.json were consulted for schema and de-duplication only. No access to the training data, its generator, paraphrase outputs, or any benchmark results. Score only: never use these cases, or failures on them, to design training data. Mix ~71 % executable / ~29 % DefaultResponse.",
  "grading": "function name exact; arguments exact after: filterNames split on ',' and compared as a set; DefaultResponse graded on function name only (text is the raw input, the app can fill it).",
  "suites": {
    "transcript": "Raw speech-recogniser output with no punctuation at all: situational remark, command and urgency run together in one stream (우측 능선 조용함 호텔팀 복귀 서둘러), spaces inserted inside words (제 어권, 삭 제, 카메 라창, 원위 치, 승 인, 귀 환) or missing between words (오번마커로이동, 팀연결선 드론시야, 카메라창축소), digits and Hangul numbers mixed (3 번 드론, 삼번드론, 2번드론), Latin-script callsigns (Alpha팀, Bravo 팀, Delta팀, tango팀, X-ray 2호기). Three refusals (self-cancel, negation, two actions).",
    "military": "Formal military register: ~할 것, ~하도록, ~바람, ~하라, ~실시, ~요망, 이상, 오버, rank/name address to a listener (김병장, 최상병, 한하사, 윤중위님), report lead-ins (현 시각, 현 시각부로, 보고합니다), control transfer to a named soldier (박하사에게, 정중사에게), five confirm-window names with 승인/거부/거절. Two refusals (unsupported altitude, negation).",
    "numbers": "Every numeric slot (droneNumber, memberCount, markerNumber, presetNumber) with values up to 16, including 11-16: digits, Sino (십이호기, 십오 번, 십사 기, 십삼번, 십육 번, 팔 번), native counts (열한, 열두, 열여섯, 여섯) with 대/기/개, ordinals (첫 번째, 두 번째, 여덟 번째, 아홉 번째, 열 번째, 열세 번째), drone numbers with and without a team, 폭격=공격 type mapping.",
    "refuse": "Must be DefaultResponse: two actions joined without punctuation, two teams at once, negation, state questions, unsupported near-tool actions (altitude, formation, fire, unknown window, unknown filter, deprecated waypoint move), deictic or missing slots (저쪽 팀, 방금 그 드론, 다음 마커, 마지막 프리셋, no drone number, no team), invalid callsigns (오메가, 레드), commands cut off before the deciding word (로미오팀 제어, 마커 삭, 시에라팀 제어권, 어 비디오 쓰루 그, 기동성 장애물, 제어권 요청), pure noise and filler.",
    "mixed": "Code-switching and spelling variants: English verbs on Korean commands (on, off, stop, close, please), loanword spellings (비디오쓰루, 비디오 스루, 패스 스루, 프리쎗, 캐머라창), honorific chains (주시기 바랍니다, 주시면 감사하겠습니다, 해 드리겠습니다). Refusals for code-switched unsupported actions (zoom in, speed up, pan left, brightness, replay)."
  },
